<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 710 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 710 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 710 contracts compared with 907 overnight Tuesday.</p>
<p>There were 15 wheat, 300 corn, 380 soybean, four soymeal, one corn call ans 10 soybean puts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1-1/4 cents higher to 3/4 lower, corn was 1/2 to 1-3/4 cents higher and soybeans were 1-1/2 to 2-1/2 cents higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
